stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: addDoc (대결 신청)

    pending --> accepted: 수락 (updateDoc status)
    pending --> rejected: 거절 (updateDoc status)
    pending --> expired: isOpen + expiresAt 경과 (UI 필터)

    accepted --> completed: submitResult (winner, score)
    accepted --> rejected: 거절 (드물게)

    completed --> completed: 관리자 결과 수정<br/>(포인트 rollback → 재적용)

    note right of pending
        instantCreate=true 이면
        생성 직후 completed 가능
    end note

    note right of completed
        _updateMatchPoints()
        members.individualPoint / doublePoint 갱신
    end note
